<h1>Phase 8: Project Demonstration Phase</h1>
<p style="font-size: 13pt; color: #4a5568;"><strong>ContentGen (BlogNest) Demonstration Protocol &amp; Links</strong></p>

<h2>1. Official Reference &amp; Media Links</h2>
<div class="links-box">
  <p>🎬 <strong>Demo Videos:</strong> <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1npyGtRjLGZtjm6-03dbNGqCpstw_St_u?usp=sharing">Google Drive Demo Videos Folder</a></p>
  <p>🧪 <strong>API Testing Video:</strong> <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mfPIZq0dpU1TAvZk6_Te9StsQXBBDaow/view?usp=drive_link">Google Drive API Testing Video</a></p>
  <p>💻 <strong>Code Drive:</strong> <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1S69VGxkcmkrsPhfJ6CE9af4Nf9WVnLsj?usp=sharing">Google Drive Source Code Folder</a></p>
</div>

<h2>2. Live Demonstration Persona Walkthrough</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Health Check:</strong> <code>GET /api/health</code> asserts server operational state.</li>
  <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> Author Priya logs in and receives stateless JWT token.</li>
  <li><strong>AI Blog Generation:</strong> Priya invokes <code>POST /api/ai/generate-blog</code> with <code>saveAsDraft: true</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Editorial Publishing:</strong> Editor Elena reviews draft and executes <code>PATCH /api/posts/:id/status</code> to <code>published</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Reader Consumption:</strong> Reader Rohan searches articles, toggles like, and posts a comment.</li>
  <li><strong>Comment Moderation:</strong> Editor Elena moderates comment flags to <code>approved</code> or <code>spam</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Analytics Governance:</strong> Priya reviews personal author metrics; Admin reviews system-wide totals.</li>
</ol>
</div>
</body>
